B.QK=new A.yT("Tsaphah Prophetic Church \u2013 Yercaud","Pastor Karthick","The Yercaud branch serves the local community through worship, prayer, preaching, and ministry, carrying forward the vision of Tsaphah Prophetic Church.",null)
